  "body": "**The fix**\n- Map background now loads from a keyless provider (Esri World Gray Canvas) — the previous tile host (CARTO) began stamping an \"API key required\" watermark on its free maps in August 2026\n- Map colors stay muted in both light and dark themes so alert zones remain the most visible element\n- Map data attribution updated honestly (Esri · HERE · Garmin)\n\n**Unchanged — your safety features**\n- Alerts, sirens and notifications work exactly as before\n- Everything still works offline from the cached snapshot after the first load\n\nNot an official government service. In an emergency, call Protection Civile: 14 or 1021.\n\nAPK: app-release.apk (universal, all devices)."
